<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom says bought back at NZ$6.94/96 shr.</title>
<headline>Telecom says bought back at NZ$6.94/96 shr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Tuesday it bought shares on- and off-market on Friday at prices of NZ$6.96 and $6.94 in the latest round of its buyback programme.</p>
<p>In statements the company said it bought 10,850 shares on market at $6.96, and 300 shares on market and 11,106 off-market both at $6.94. The buyback is set to continue until Telecom advises it has completed the current phase.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
</text>
